#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/mlab_pipeline_sources.rst:408
msgid ""
"If 4 positional arguments (x, y, z, s) are passed, the 3 first are arrays "
"giving the 3D coordinates of the data points, and the last one is an array "
