"scale is a float value.                          If you specify 'auto', the "
"scale is calculated to give a pleasant aspect ratio to the plot, whatever "
"the bounds of the data. If you specify a value for warp_scale in addition to"
" an extent, the warp scale will be determined by the warp_scale, and the "
